EDICT 0003: capture points in the QuakeC VM

Category: harness hook, no change in results.
Five macro lines (and two braces) in PR_ExecuteProgram for the record mode -edictcapture (ref/src/edict_capture.c,
docs/TESTING.md, Capture): entry from the engine (before PR_EnterFunction, which already writes globals), return to
it, QuakeC-to-QuakeC calls, and builtin calls before and after. The macros test one int and call the capture code only while a capture file is open; the capture code
reads the VM state and writes it to the file, it changes nothing. Checked when added: the per-frame hashes of all
10 R9 maps and the hull trace corpora are identical with and without the patch, with and without -edictcapture.

